</style><h2>Blinky 1.5.17</h2><ul><li><strong>The Token window closes from the red close button.</strong> A click inside the window, a click outside it, and Escape leave it open.</li><li><strong>The Token window keeps its notes on one line.</strong> The breakdown menu no longer repeats its choice, and pricing and unread sources open from “About these figures”.</li><li><strong>The usage card shows the whole provider name.</strong> The header icons sit together, and pointing at one shows what it does.</li><li><strong>Reset cards take one row, and Use is a button.</strong> Codex, Zhipu, and z.ai show how many are left, and the date and Use open from that row, still after a confirmation.</li></ul><p><a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/releases/tag/v1.5.17">Release notes on GitHub</a></p>]]></description>
